  "_note": "Names somebody chose, used instead of the made-up one for exactly that body and second animal. Pandillo is the name Chelsea chose for hers. Porkypine is a name Randimals and Stimpunks made together and both use, and it is what a pig with the most of its other parts from a porcupine is called. Liger and tigon are the names English already has for a lion and a tiger together, the lion first in a liger and the tiger first in a tigon.",
